OpenCode Pet (ds-pet-in-anywhere)
=================================

A standalone macOS desktop pet that mirrors OpenCode session state.

This product is a derivative port of dsh-pet:
  https://github.com/PC2005-cloud/dsh-pet
  upstream commit: 8b4c1ea (v0.4.7)

Port repository:
  https://github.com/AZEROSTART/ds-pet-in-anywhere

